{"agent":"bg36","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":2,"detail":"The guard only recognizes `monkeypatch.setattr` calls whose target is a bare `ast.Name` previously bound to `ddflow.infra.log` via an aliased import. It misses a test file containing `import ddflow.infra.log` (no alias) and then `monkeypatch.setattr(ddflow.infra.log, \"APPEND_HOOKS\", [...])`: `_log_package_bindings` ignores that import because `alias.asname` is `None`, and `_patched_on_package` skips that target because it is an `ast.Attribute`, not an `ast.Name`. This is exactly the package-level by-value re-export patch the new guard is supposed to refuse, but the guard passes.","digest":"55b2218c70845f06","location":"tests/test_no_reexport_patches.py:_patched_on_package","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_no_reexport_patches.py:_patched_on_package"},{"chunk":1,"detail":"The guard only flags `monkeypatch.setattr` when the target is a bare `ast.Name` previously bound as an alias of `ddflow.infra.log`. A test that does `import ddflow.infra.log` and `monkeypatch.setattr(ddflow.infra.log, \"APPEND_HOOKS\", [boom])` (target is an `ast.Attribute`) or `monkeypatch.setattr(\"ddflow.infra.log.APPEND_HOOKS\", [boom])` (pytest string form; `args[1]` is not the name constant) rebinds only the package copy, so the submodule still reads the original. `_patched_on_package` returns `[]`, `test_no_test_patches_an_infra_log_reexport_on_the_package` passes, and the vacuous patch the test exists to refuse is missed.","digest":"b121a89da18de722","location":"tests/test_no_reexport_patches.py:_patched_on_package","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_no_reexport_patches.py:_patched_on_package"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":6062,"diff_sha":"884172e9e7dc17b3642a3584a868528169ba719f3a0a03bfd9cb2ea5ddcedfcf","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":0.8,"family":"deepseek","findings":2,"max_chunk_chars":12000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"aaf165b9d61e4d60","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-B-log-reexport-patch-passes-vacuously.critic.gemini-3.5-flash-lite.20261107T143327Z-0624da86.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"50c257342acde8fbd2aa06dd37e731b04ea0e9f0","reviewed_paths":{"tests/test_compat_derived.py":"100644 8796a15056eb72ef9c823d9f4586decf444d602b","tests/test_log_snapshot.py":"100644 fc61e69c2532fef85f6df7cca4c7ac38f9945562","tests/test_no_reexport_patches.py":"100644 807bc91dd8db6ff68c8587f22fbe01ad3fc2a070","tests/test_shard_high_water.py":"100644 dc6a9355b8e170dcc9a10c38bcdd8bb0d79926e0"},"reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4-pro","reviewer_digest":"dd08c1466c2b8632","reviewer_families":["deepseek","google","xai"],"round":1,"rounds":1,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["tests/test_no_reexport_patches.py:_patched_on_package","tests/test_no_reexport_patches.py:_patched_on_package"],"tree_sha":"50c257342acd+clean","unreviewed":[],"waves":1},"gate":"critic","reason":"2 finding(s)"},"id":"e20a95b2aee1d0256ab4aec55","kind":"gate.failed","lamport":149251,"schema":1,"subject":"fix-B-log-reexport-patch-passes-vacuously","ts":"2026-11-07T14:33:56.771468Z"}
